<title>CANADA: Horsham in talks on Clark USA deal.</title>
<headline>Horsham in talks on Clark USA deal.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horsham Corp is in talks with a number of possible buyers for its 46 percent held Clark USA Inc unit and hopes to unveil a deal before the end of the year, said Horsham president Greg Wilkins on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We think that the refining and marketing industry is in consolidation,&quot; Wilkins told reporters at a news briefing about Horsham's proposed merger with real estate affiliate Trizec Corp. &quot;We think that Clark will participate in the consolidation as a consolidatee. We are in discussions with a number of interested parties and we would be hopeful to try to surface something before the end of the year,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
